  september 2026 11:00-12:00 (UTC+01:00) Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Bern\, Oslo\, 
 Roma\, Wien.\nHvor: Brakkerigg - Andre etasje - Møterom Tordenstua\n\nProvi
 de a practical walkthrough of how Dalux is used on Thor and the main day-to
 -day workflows (Bjorn Inge / Arne / Dalux Key User(s))\n• Cover document an
 d drawing management\, field collaboration\, QA/QC\, snagging\, inspections
  / checklists\, reporting and handover / commissioning where applicable (Da
 lux Key User)\n• Discuss implementation experience\, adoption\, strengths\,
  limitations and potential relevance for future NIP-supported projects (Fab
 io / Bjorn Inge / Arne)\n\n------\nThis e-mail is confidential and may also
  be privileged. It is intended for use by the addressee only. If you are no
